# {{title}}

An API built with [eaglet](https://github.com/uniqtechteam/eaglet).

```bash
cargo run            # http://localhost:3000, API docs at http://localhost:3000/docs
cargo test
```

Add a feature with the eaglet command line:

```bash
eaglet g resource products   # module, controller, service, DTOs and tests, added to AppModule
eaglet g module billing
eaglet g controller billing
eaglet g service billing
```

Settings come from the environment; see `.env.example`.
